	"data": "Journal Archaeology — 2026-08-25\n\nJournals Read\n\nApril 4, 2020 — \"Old Wounds.\" cithoreal at 22, midnight on 4/4, a \"universal four day.\" Talking about Ryan rejecting him (the start of social anxiety), sabotaging the relationship with Rebecca to test whether she'd stay, Alex leaving and hurting deeply. The explicit naming: \"I have a habit of ruining things before things get too far along at this point. Because I guess I'm too afraid of the other person leaving.\" And the reframing sentence: \"I…",
